FIs5VoWsON.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/c7btGYblBnfAaw713WvFM0Kimc7.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Odysseus, the legendary King of Ithaca, embarks on a long and perilous journey home following the Trojan War. Throughout his voyage, he is forced to confront the whims of gods, mythological monsters, and trials that stretch both his cunning and his humanity to the breaking point.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Action\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1300968,\"title\":\"The Hunger Games: Sunrise on the Reaping\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nzIXSQNgYZwFOMrmv0d0I3ulvkM.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/aqFZcr2dxSZ2UwWSo1WC6C0rwDf.jpg\",\"rating\":7.8,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Return to the world of Panem 24 years before Katniss Everdeen volunteers in her sister's place, commencing on the morning of the reaping of the 50th Hunger Games, also known as the Second Quarter Quell.\",\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi\",\"Action\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":969681,\"title\":\"Spider-Man: Brand New Day\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bjiS5ipwxb9JFy3XRRN4OAilSeX.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/subj7knTn4DeS6KS7qI66EQKe9i.jpg\",\"rating\":8.5,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Fighting crime full-time as Spider-Man in a world that doesn't remember him—and the pressure of seeing his old friends move on without him—sparks a change in Peter Parker he may not have the power to control. But that transformation might also be the only thing that can stop a shocking new threat to the city and those he loves - a powerful villain no one can even see.\",\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi\",\"Action\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":299534,\"title\":\"Avengers: Endgame\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jtDv3lCnST0fZRvdYFwR5CVwK2x.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7RyHsO4yDXtBv1zUU3mTpHeQ0d5.jpg\",\"rating\":8.2,\"year\":2019,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After the devastating events of Avengers: Infinity War, the universe is in ruins due to the efforts of the Mad Titan, Thanos. With the help of remaining allies, the Avengers must assemble once more in order to undo Thanos' actions and restore order to the universe once and for all, no matter what consequences may be in store.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Sci-Fi\",\"Action\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1148365,\"title\":\"Matchbox the Movie\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/aHhHRz6nOpwkqJs5ASeRGAdK2dt.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jdJsnhHfkIi3J7jwfiCFT4gXNx5.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When a group of former childhood friends reconnect, their reunion takes a wild turn as they stumble upon a dangerous international plot—and must save the world.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Comedy\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":980431,\"title\":\"Avatar Aang: The Last Airbender\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3sgnSfNT27Bx5O5ukr7B26mhEQq.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ezbrL1dMymKQZw7mDEWa2ZTzN7d.jpg\",\"rating\":9,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Avatar Aang, the world's last Airbender, learns of an ancient power that could save his culture from extinction. With the help of his friends, he embarks on a global quest to find it before it falls into the wrong hands and threatens to upend the peace they sacrificed everything to achieve.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Adventure\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"0CoJ66T8gFc\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"8uJVoj-GS0o\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"6X9BDSkeU7U\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"r